      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Union-find</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Graph DFS / BFS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/number-of-connected-components-in-an-undirected-graph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 323</a> <span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Number of Connected Components in an Undirected Graph</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Start with n separate nodes and let every edge try to merge two groups. Each successful merge removes exactly one component, so the answer is n minus the number of successful unions. Union-find does it in near-linear time; DFS or BFS over an adjacency list is the equally good alternative.</p>\n"
  },
